{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>綜藝節目《女神配對計劃2》於20日播出第三集，27 歲的健身教練林子朗（Lico）一出場便備受矚目，不少網民指他外表有少少「撞樣」MC 張天賦，火速掀起熱烈討論！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_f852fd614bae7f9f-615\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>林子朗在節目中即場示範最擅長的「街頭健身」，不論是超高難度動作，還是其身上極致爆肌的線條，均引發全場女神及花生團接連尖叫，展現出極強的個人魅力！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f852fd614bae7f9f-615\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c132ccdc-d321-47d0-a6bf-053ba9d7002b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026pBYxX7iF2T1789959362.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c132ccdc-d321-47d0-a6bf-053ba9d7002b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_f852fd614bae7f9f-616\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>節目中，陳若思（Amber）的閨密劉倬昕（Sam）敏銳地留意到林子朗身上不少位置都有紋身，便特別提醒陳若思需主動詢問背後的涵義與緣由，藉此判斷二人的價值觀與感情觀是否合襯。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f852fd614bae7f9f-616\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"db8f3b26-8e63-4dfb-85c8-eb6f7c0ca757.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026b6beQOc5c11789959361.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"db8f3b26-8e63-4dfb-85c8-eb6f7c0ca757.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3fc96c5e-db30-48d5-b064-54dc61239ea1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026FraNBOX15h1789959361.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3fc96c5e-db30-48d5-b064-54dc61239ea1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_f852fd614bae7f9f-617\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>提到紋身的由來，林子朗大方舉例解釋自己右臂上的第一個紋身：「呢隻係我最鍾意嘅狗狗，2020年嘅時候走咗，由我細個陪到我大個。」他更展示紋身旁的英文歌詞，感性表示：「呢句英文其實係一句歌詞：『You’ll always be my side till the day I die.』我紋咗佢落去就係一世，到我死嗰刻，一齊入土為葬。」故事相當催淚感動。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_f852fd614bae7f9f-618\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>林子朗的心儀女神陳若思非常認可他的重情重義，花生團成員鄧凱文亦忍不住大嗌：「So sweet！」游嘉欣同樣被其真誠深深打動，表示：「其實我覺得呢個男仔都幾啱Roxanne。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T03:20:01.348461+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":504,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}